{ message: <<EOM
Since 0.159, codex starts a shared background app server (daemon) by
default.  The daemon installs itself from a packaged Codex layout
(codex-package.json), which this port does not provide, so codex fails
at startup with:

  Error: this CLI has no complete local package; install a packaged
  Codex CLI or use the standalone installer

To work without the background server, add the following to
~/.codex/config.toml:

  [features]
  daemon_auto_start = false

Alternatively, pass --no-daemon on each invocation.  Features that
require the shared server, such as "codex agents", are unavailable.
EOM
}
